  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e50ba17086dd0d441b315907b988fb9a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  manager: {fileID: 1823232039}
  lines:
  - Welcome, maintenance personnel.
  - You have been assigned to a shutdown procedure within this sector.
  - I want you to shut down the air machine over there. It's not supposed to be running
    right now.
  - Should be a control button somewhere on the console. Just press it and the system
    will power down.
  - "Honestly\u2026 it's nice to finally have someone handling these maintenance
    tasks."
  - "Most people never even make it this far.\"  \"So\u2026 thank you for taking
    care of it."
  - Anyway, I should probably get going now. Goodluck in there.
  voices:
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: a2fe71823deea5d479110d0f704a090e, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: e256b05671897aa47a2a1a8088b5bed9, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 88fb5fc52f423964caa1a392f333157d, type: 3}
